 "notes": [
  "Starting (8) as posted: the Profit objective, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber, Tatooine: Jabba's Palace, Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Strike Planning, Insurrection and Staging Areas; they count toward the 60.",
  "DeckTech tagged the post Dark; the list is a Light Profit deck (Light objective and cards), so it is filed as Light.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine Jabba's Palace' dested Tatooine: Jabba's Palace (Special Edition), the Light printing the Profit objective deploys (the plain page is the Dark Jabba's Palace-set card).",
  "Posted 'Dash' x2 (in the Interrupts section) dested the Cloud City Interrupt Dash, used in the strategy to react characters over; not Dash Rendar.",
  "Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber appears twice as posted (once starting, once under Locations).",
  "No Tatooine-set cards in the list; format Premiere - Reflections II.",
  "Same author posted a near-identical list two days later as 'Prototype in Production' (14749): Corporal Kensaric for Lieutenant Greeve and Jabba's Palace: Entrance Cavern for the second Audience Chamber."
 ],
